# UGV + UAV shelf inspection (ugv_uav_mission_node): the UGV carries the UAV to the aisle position
# (shelf_x, shelf_y) and stops there; the UAV takes off from it, inspects the `side` shelf of that
# aisle segment and hovers where it leaves the aisle; the UGV drives below it, the UAV lands on it
# (precision landing) and is re-attached; then the UGV carries it back to where the UGV started. Positions in the shared control frame ("world").
float64 shelf_x
float64 shelf_y
string side        # "left" (+y rack row of the aisle) or "right" (-y rack row)
---
bool success
string message
